      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your grief is valid; you are mourning the loss of your highest self, not just a relationship or a routine. Many people struggle through the same profound identity crisis after long-term partners leave, finding it disorienting to reconstruct a sense of self from scratch. Please remember that this \"dead\" version of yourself is a former part of you, and yes, they are gone, but your current life begins the moment you accept you have a future worth living without them.",
