    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but it feels so exhausting to keep trying. like, why am i supposed to keep building this new person when the only person i actually liked is gone? it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, empty body around for no reason. it's like i'm just waiting for something to end because there's nothing left worth staying for.",
